      timeline: [
        'Traditional Golf: Simple layout and replacement game.',
        '1990s-2000s: Rise of folk variants adding action powers (Cambio, Pablo, Cumbia).',
        "2010: Commercial versions like 'Cabo' bring the mechanics to a wider audience.",
        "Modern: 'Dacz' remains a popular social variant in Poland.",
      ],
      evolution: "The game shifted from a purely solitaire-like optimization game (Standard Golf) into a highly interactive 'take-that' style game where an opponent's layout is no longer safe from swaps.",
